; C14 native property-implied examples; each bad directive is checked separately.
; 4-bit 2*x = 10 permits x in {5,13}: bounds, disequalities, and (x & 7) = 5.
1 sort bitvec 1
2 sort bitvec 4
3 sort bitvec 2
4 sort array 3 2
5 state 2 x
6 state 2 y
7 input 1 enable
8 state 4 memory
9 input 3 address
10 constd 2 2
11 mul 2 5 10
12 constd 2 10
13 eq 1 11 12
14 bad -13 modular_word_property
; Whole-word equality, without Boolean bit-pair expansion.
15 eq 1 5 6
16 bad -15 word_equality_property
; A conditional word bound with an unconstrained input guard.
17 constd 2 3
18 ulte 1 5 17
19 implies 1 7 18
20 bad -19 guarded_bound_property
; A native array read relation.
21 read 2 8 9
22 eq 1 21 5
23 bad -22 array_read_property
